---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import ContactInvitation from './ContactInvitation.astro';
import InvestorCompare from './InvestorCompare.astro';
import DecisionLens from './DecisionLens.astro';
import QualityPlate from './QualityPlate.astro';
import {investorFieldQuestions} from '../data/investor-field-questions';
import {getIndustries,getMilestones,getSiteContent} from '../data/content';
import '../styles/research-investor-quality.css';
interface Props {draft?:boolean;}
const {draft=false}=Astro.props;
const fields=await getIndustries(draft),milestones=await getMilestones(draft),content=await getSiteContent(draft);
---
<Layout noindex={draft} title='Investors' description='Start an investor conversation with NRTH Inc. Understand its venture directions, the questions behind them and the information needed to assess the next step.'>
 {draft&&<aside class='preview-banner'><a href='/preview'>Editorial workspace</a><span data-preview-status>Draft preview</span></aside>}
 <section class='page-heading'><span class='section-label'>{content.investors.label}</span><h1>Look beyond<br/><em>a single field.</em></h1><p>{content.investors.copy}</p><a class='inline-link' href='/contact?project=investor'>Start an investor conversation</a></section>
 <div class='investor-formation'><QualityPlate kind='research' variant='investor' label='Several directions. One considered perspective.'/></div>
 <section class='investor-reading-route' aria-label='Investor information routes'><div data-enter><h2>A public starting point.</h2><p>Read the company identity, explore nine venture directions across six fields and compare the people, questions and dependencies each direction considers.</p><nav aria-label='Public portfolio reading'><a href='/resources/nrth-company-overview.pdf' download>Company overview</a><a href='#investor-comparison'>Compare venture directions</a></nav></div><div data-enter><h2>A direct conversation.</h2><p>Request the current company information relevant to your interest. Development status, financial information, capital needs, ownership and any proposed terms require confirmation with NRTH.</p><nav aria-label='Begin an investor discussion'><a href='/contact?project=investor&topic=Current%20company%20information'>Request company information</a></nav></div></section>
 <section class='editorial-split'><div data-enter><span class='section-label'>The perspective</span><h2>A portfolio is<br/>a set of questions.</h2></div><div data-enter><p>What problem is worth solving? Who needs a different approach? What evidence would make the next decision more informed?</p><p>NRTH's nine venture identities frame different areas of interest. Examine each relevant direction on its own terms before considering how knowledge, systems or relationships could connect it to another.</p><dl class='investor-scope-record'><div><dt>Direction</dt><dd>The people, problem and area of interest a venture identity describes.</dd></div><div><dt>Work</dt><dd>The research, concepts or other supporting materials that can be reviewed today.</dd></div><div><dt>Current scope</dt><dd>The development status, responsibilities and limitations confirmed for the discussion.</dd></div></dl></div></section>
 <section class='editorial-split section-dark investor-fields'><div data-enter><span class='section-label'>Explore the portfolio</span><h2>A wider lens.<br/>A longer view.</h2><p class='investor-fields-intro'>Start with one field. Understand its distinct questions, then follow the venture identities and the evidence a focused discussion would need.</p></div><div class='disclosure-list' data-enter>{fields.map((field,i)=>{const review=investorFieldQuestions[field.name];return <details open={i===0}><summary>{field.name}<Icon name='plus'/></summary><div><p>{review?.context||field.copy}</p>{review&&<dl class='investor-field-review'><div><dt>A useful starting material</dt><dd>{review.review}</dd></div><div><dt>The question to examine</dt><dd>{review.question}</dd></div></dl>}<div class='investor-field-ventures'>{field.ventures.map(name=><a href={'/projects/nrth-'+name.toLowerCase()}>NRTH {name}</a>)}</div><a class='investor-field-guide' href={'/industries/'+field.name.toLowerCase()}>Read the {field.name.toLowerCase()} field guide</a></div></details>})}</div></section>
 <InvestorCompare draft={draft}/>
 <DecisionLens mode='investor'/>
 <section class='investor-conversation'><div class='investor-conversation-heading' data-enter><div><span class='section-label'>The first conversation</span><h2>Begin with<br/>the substance.</h2></div><p>Bring a specific interest and the perspective behind it. The first exchange can establish which materials and people would make a closer discussion useful.</p></div><div class='investor-conversation-list'><article data-enter><h3>A direction<br/>to examine.</h3><p>Identify a venture, industry or relationship in the portfolio that interests you. Explain the problem you see and the experience informing your interest.</p><dl><div><dt>Bring</dt><dd>A field, a representative use case and the question you would like to explore.</dd></div><div><dt>Ask for</dt><dd>The current scope, relevant work and the right context for a venture discussion.</dd></div></dl><a href='/contact?project=investor&topic=Venture%20direction%20and%20current%20scope'>Discuss a venture direction</a></article><article data-enter><h3>Information<br/>to review.</h3><p>Request the materials relevant to the opportunity you are considering. Establish what is available, what needs context and what calls for a private exchange.</p><dl><div><dt>Bring</dt><dd>Your information needs and the purpose of the proposed review.</dd></div><div><dt>Ask for</dt><dd>Relevant company information, supporting evidence and the conditions of a closer discussion.</dd></div></dl><a href='/contact?project=investor&topic=Company%20information%20and%20supporting%20materials'>Request relevant materials</a></article><article data-enter><h3>A next step<br/>with a purpose.</h3><p>Discuss what another conversation or review would need to establish. Define the question, responsible participants and the decision the next step could support.</p><dl><div><dt>Bring</dt><dd>The uncertainty you need to resolve before taking the discussion further.</dd></div><div><dt>Ask for</dt><dd>A focused scope, appropriate participants and an agreed way to evaluate the next step.</dd></div></dl><a href='/contact?project=investor&topic=Scope%20and%20next%20review%20decision'>Define a focused next step</a></article></div></section>
 {milestones.length>0&&<section class='page-body'><div class='section-heading'><h2>Recorded<br/>progress.</h2></div><div class='journal-grid'>{milestones.map(item=><article><span class='section-label'>{item.date}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></article>)}</div></section>}
 <section class='resource-strip' data-enter><div><h3>A concise introduction.</h3><p>Download the public company overview to review NRTH's identity and venture directions.</p></div><a class='inline-link' href='/resources/nrth-company-overview.pdf' download>Company overview</a></section>
 <ContactInvitation project='investor' headline='Consider the possibilities.'/>
</Layout>
